# (2026-11-24) The hotspot, step 2 (r277): a minute after the start the radio becomes an access point (src/hotspot.c, the
# name and passphrase from /private/var/root/hakios-hotspot, which build.sh takes from ssh/hotspot), for a phone or tablet
# to join; the kernel's log has the authentication, the association and the handshake.
/redwood/bin/quietboot &
/var/jb/usr/bin/sleep 60
/redwood/bin/hotspot on &
/var/jb/usr/bin/sleep 5
/redwood/bin/hotspot status
/var/jb/usr/bin/sleep 300
/redwood/bin/hotspot status
/var/jb/usr/bin/sleep 36000
